#: data/body_info.json
msgid "Pluto is a small, icy world far beyond Neptune. It was called the ninth planet until 2006, when astronomers named it a dwarf planet."
msgstr ""

#: data/body_info.json
msgid "Retrograde rotation with a sidereal period of about 243 days, longer than its 225-day orbit."
