msgid "Saturn is famous for its bright rings, which are made of countless pieces of ice and rock."
msgstr ""

#: data/body_info.json
msgid "Saturn is less dense than water, so it would float in a giant bathtub."
msgstr ""

#: data/body_info.json
msgid "Scientists think Europa is one of the best places to look for life beyond Earth."
msgstr ""

#: data/body_info.json
msgid "Sidereal rotation period of about 17.2 hours, retrograde."
